00:00:14.982 --> 00:00:21.255 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le maniement des armes.

00:00:18.919 --> 00:00:22.456 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "C'est important, dit-elle,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
parce que je veux faire quelque

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:24.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
