00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:28.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maison et m'inquiéter de ne pas

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:29.463 size:53% position:73% line:53%
savoir quoi fa c c c ce qui va

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:30.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
