00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:07.688 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que nous ne le saurions sans

00:03:05.319 --> 00:03:08.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
doute pas non plus. Nous avons

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:10.123 size:53% position:73% line:53%
