00:03:31.779 --> 00:03:35.549 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Ce que nous avons vu à

00:03:33.013 --> 00:03:36.784 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Boutcha, dit-elle, la même chose

00:03:34.448 --> 00:03:37.985 size:53% position:73% line:53%
