00:03:38.085 --> 00:03:47.928 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est très douloureux."

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:53.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 C'est ce qu'elle venue dire

00:03:46.794 --> 00:03:54.668 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à ce petit groupe de citoyens

00:03:48.028 --> 00:03:55.903 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s s s s s s s s s s ukrainiens

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:57.104 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rassemblés au centre de

00:03:54.768 --> 00:03:58.338 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Stockholm par un samedi

00:03:56.003 --> 00:03:59.540 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pluvieux. Karin Karlsbro n'avait

00:03:57.204 --> 00:04:00.774 size:53% position:73% line:53%
