00:04:10.684 --> 00:04:14.221 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Maintenant, c'est urgent,

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:19.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-elle e e e e e e e e e e en

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:20.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ukraine a réveillé la société

00:04:14.321 --> 00:04:21.995 size:53% position:73% line:53%
