00:04:19.693 --> 00:04:23.230 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Si tous sont visiblement, comme

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:24.465 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle, bouleversés par le sort de

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:25.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'Ukraine, ils ne partagent pas

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
